  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You look down at your hand, suddenly finding yourself a finger short and a raw bleeding stump richer. Was that the “Whack!” noise you heard as that arrow flew by?</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Lose one finger (see @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.SYjWiKDzMS6CtROJ]{Amputatied Parts}). Also, the blood streaming from your hand is good enough for a -10 penalty to any Tests using that hand due to a slippery grip, until you’ve had some sort of Medical Attention (or the end of the encounter, whichever comes first).</p><p>No Extraction is necessary.</p>"
    },
